 Drop webhook: Inv++/webhook_<userId>.json (local URL/settings); confirmed new drops only.
 BEST marks the strongest fully upgraded copy of each item name and slot.
 Duplicate groups preserve rarity; click the xN badge while grouping to expand.
 Tooltip: current class stat, fully upgraded value, gold cost, roll range and gap to perfect.
